{"ID":"20240118151115-f8kukmb","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118151115-f8kukmb","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151115-f8kukmb\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151115-qgi1rzh\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122133757-nixljsd\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122133757-nixljsd\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:121,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:121\u0026#125;","title":"212秦皮","type":"doc","updated":"20240201164702"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118151115-qgi1rzh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118151115-qgi1rzh","updated":"20240122133738"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味苦，微寒，无毒。治风寒湿痹，洒洒寒气，除热，目中青翳，白膜。久服头不白，轻身。生川谷。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122133741-nmuxcin","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122133741-nmuxcin"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】产我国陕西河南等地，树皮入药。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122133742-8o8u66z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122133742-8o8u66z"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】味苦，性寒，无毒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122133744-ricnenj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122133744-ricnenj"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】秦皮为收敛除热要药，主痢疾带下，男子少精，治风湿痹，目中翳膜，除肝热，补下焦。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122133746-lmi9cjp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122133746-lmi9cjp"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【别录】疗男子少精，妇人带下，小儿痫身热，可作洗目汤，久服皮肤光泽肥大有子。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122133747-fhqqpna","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122133747-fhqqpna"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【甄权】痛风泪不止，作汤浴小儿身热，煎水澄清洗赤目极效。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122133749-3ul6f8b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122133749-3ul6f8b"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【容川】此药象人之皮，味苦兼降湿热。故仲景用治皮肤发黄之症。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122133750-93qdhzy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122133750-93qdhzy"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】一般二至五钱。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122133752-417fw55","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122133752-417fw55"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】里寒之症不用。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122133740-wcmlzu4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122133740-wcmlzu4"}},{"ID":"20240122133752-08p66s3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122133752-08p66s3"}},{"ID":"20240122133752-kwbv6y0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122133752-kwbv6y0","updated":"20240201163926"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"秦皮，这个秦皮外用的很有名的，那就是你熬汤药，三碗熬成一碗，熬成一碗以后你把那个渣滤掉，用那个滤网把那滤掉，或者是我用那个汗衫放上去把它滤掉，那个比较干净的没有残渣，这个洗眼睛很好啊。目赤、眼痒、刺痛。我们那个角膜炎、结膜炎，用秦皮的汤来洗眼睛，外用可以洗眼睛。那它本经的原文呢是味苦，微寒，那治风寒湿痹，眼中有青衣、白膜，都可以使用，它是苦味的药，性寒，是收敛除热的药，眼中的衣膜干热，这个上面都有写。"}]},{"ID":"20240122133757-nixljsd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122133757-nixljsd","updated":"20240201164702"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我们在临床上使用的时侯，皮肤病的时侯用得很多。秦皮，还有皮肤发黄也在使用。这个最主要就是除热的，也就是说如果是寒症的话，秦皮我们就不用。热症我们会用。那张仲景也有用秦皮，介绍到那边的时侯我可以再跟诸位再深入介绍这秦皮的功能。还有秦皮的功能这里没写出。"}]}]}